{"steam_appid":3949550,"steam_name":"1666: Amsterdam","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3949550/1476819517/c1aa9535f4a3e7afa10e3737e78b67bef53ebedd/1787650518/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1787685752","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257407961/a8c017c0362648afbee833fb79cdf98833d376d4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1787685752","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/ddde9a71fcf609a91ae53474d881528eb2420241/ss_ddde9a71fcf609a91ae53474d881528eb2420241.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787686479","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/fe43310f0b0daaea2b8a32010016dfdf11ef48e6/ss_fe43310f0b0daaea2b8a32010016dfdf11ef48e6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787686479","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/7aa260b58332e75cafe3eaa0e9477cd16babecc7/ss_7aa260b58332e75cafe3eaa0e9477cd16babecc7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787686479","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/83ece33dd8c0d8928faf4f3e8521ff7b1f0b681e/ss_83ece33dd8c0d8928faf4f3e8521ff7b1f0b681e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787686479","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/21b2598efbd1dd69e8e0565b984cbdbc621f5b39/ss_21b2598efbd1dd69e8e0565b984cbdbc621f5b39.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787686479"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Amsterdam, 1666.  A city built on wealth, power, and sheer will, but now fueled by a sinister force it did not forge…</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities known as The Originals have lived for centuries, granted time, granted power, and the freedom to abuse both. That power is now owed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noa Brooklyn was born The Collector, raised by the Zaindaris for a purpose she did not choose: taking that power back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/bc7f931f1080904ee172186435d31ed9.poster.avif?t=1787686479\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/bc7f931f1080904ee172186435d31ed9.webm?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/bc7f931f1080904ee172186435d31ed9.mp4?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/ff4f4b3ef4ef50e7f8613b5177804772.poster.avif?t=1787686479\" width=1168 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/ff4f4b3ef4ef50e7f8613b5177804772.webm?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/ff4f4b3ef4ef50e7f8613b5177804772.mp4?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted Amsterdam by day. At night, uncover what lies beneath its surface. Every facade carries a gablestone. Not all of them tell the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/4f5077b6586d56c4c9618b204045b994.poster.avif?t=1787686479\" width=1170 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/4f5077b6586d56c4c9618b204045b994.webm?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/4f5077b6586d56c4c9618b204045b994.mp4?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Originals walk among Amsterdam’s citizens, hidden behind human faces. Identify them. Mark them. When the Esbat comes, confront them in their true form under the moon. Collect what is owed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/61037170101f01bc61aab8f8a6037be0.poster.avif?t=1787686479\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/61037170101f01bc61aab8f8a6037be0.webm?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/61037170101f01bc61aab8f8a6037be0.mp4?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/fe98f73e125fa6a7fe5722d377fa3914.poster.avif?t=1787686479\" width=1168 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/fe98f73e125fa6a7fe5722d377fa3914.webm?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/fe98f73e125fa6a7fe5722d377fa3914.mp4?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noa commands witchcraft and spellcasting passed down through generations of Zaindaris. Each target can be approached in multiple ways. Strategy, timing, and choice define the outcome. Every Esbat is a reckoning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/57466f8f8253d2cb6b2eb30ddbbfae56.poster.avif?t=1787686479\" width=1168 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/57466f8f8253d2cb6b2eb30ddbbfae56.webm?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/57466f8f8253d2cb6b2eb30ddbbfae56.mp4?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noa is not alone. Aaron, summoned from 1999, now sees the world through the eyes of a cat. Together, they are one: Switch between Noa and Aaron across two radically different playstyles. One wields witchcraft. The other has four paws and flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/4358f7c50599c9ccffdbb336fa92e5c0.poster.avif?t=1787686479\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/4358f7c50599c9ccffdbb336fa92e5c0.webm?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949550/extras/4358f7c50599c9ccffdbb336fa92e5c0.mp4?t=1787686479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the creators of <i>Ancestors: The Humankind Odyssey</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Panache Digital Games</strong></i> is an independent studio founded by Patrice Désilets, creative director of <i><strong>Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time</strong></i> and <i><strong>Assassin’s Creed.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core I7-10700K@3.8GHz or AMD Ryzen 5 3600 @ 3.6GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce RTX 2060 Super 8GB or AMD Radeon RX 6600 8GB or Intel Arc 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Required; Hardware Ray Tracing Required (8GB)</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core I7-12700K@3.8GHz or AMD Ryzen 7 7700 @ 3.8GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce RTX 3080Ti 12GB or AMD Radeon RX 7700 12GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Required; Hardware Ray Tracing Required (8GB)</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Early Access"],"developers":["Panache Digital Games"],"publishers":["Panache Digital Games"],"release_date":"Aug 25, 2026"}